      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The system design layer documents WisprSync as a data model and export process, not as a Python package. It defines the source shape in Wispr Flow, the normalized record shape used by WisprSync, and the file tree contracts that downstream tools can depend on."
